*> Literal subscripts and reference modifiers outside their item. Those
*> computed at run time, and lists with the wrong number of subscripts,
*> are not checked here.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. RANGES.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  MONTH-TABLE.
    05  MONTH-NAME      PIC X(9) OCCURS 12 TIMES.
01  GRID.
    05  GRID-ROW        OCCURS 3 TIMES.
        10  GRID-CELL   PIC 9 OCCURS 4 TIMES.
01  CODE-TEXT           PIC X(8) VALUE "ABCDEFGH".
01  WIDE-TEXT           PIC N(4).
01  AMOUNT              PIC S9(5) COMP-3 VALUE 0.
01  I                   PIC 99 VALUE 1.
01  OUT-TEXT            PIC X(20).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE "JANUARY" TO MONTH-NAME (1)
    MOVE "DECEMBER" TO MONTH-NAME (12)
    MOVE "SMARCH" TO MONTH-NAME (13)
    MOVE "NONE" TO MONTH-NAME (0)
    MOVE MONTH-NAME (I) TO OUT-TEXT
    MOVE MONTH-NAME (I + 12) TO OUT-TEXT
    MOVE 1 TO GRID-CELL (3, 4)
    MOVE 1 TO GRID-CELL (4 1)
    MOVE 1 TO GRID-CELL (2 5)
    MOVE 1 TO GRID-CELL (5)
    MOVE CODE-TEXT (1:8) TO OUT-TEXT
    MOVE CODE-TEXT (8:) TO OUT-TEXT
    MOVE CODE-TEXT (5:6) TO OUT-TEXT
    MOVE CODE-TEXT (9:) TO OUT-TEXT
    MOVE CODE-TEXT (0:2) TO OUT-TEXT
    MOVE CODE-TEXT (I:9) TO OUT-TEXT
    MOVE MONTH-NAME (2) (1:10) TO OUT-TEXT
    MOVE MONTH-NAME (14) (1:3) TO OUT-TEXT
    MOVE WIDE-TEXT (3:4) TO OUT-TEXT
    DISPLAY AMOUNT
    STOP RUN.
